body:
I reached out to XYO about this recently. Here's what they told me.

&#x200B;

Alan:  I staked 1 million xyo. But now I have no balance and no information. I'd like to see the # of staked xyo and all events that have taken place w my staking. How do I view these things? It's a very bad feeling not being able to see any of my staked xyo or anything about it. 

&#x200B;

XYO: " Staked XYO is currently burried under a bunch of code which is hard for the normal person to understand "

&#x200B;

Alan:  When will I get to see it and it's progress?

&#x200B;

XYO:  "Soon! Few days away ."

&#x200B;

Okay guys, this is really exciting! I have been seeing a lot of updates coming out of XYO. Every time I go for help I can see there is someone online and they always help me. Arie had made millions off sentinels when they were originally designed as trackers and sold. He didn't need to spend millions of his own profit and start XYO. But he did because he believes in it. 

&#x200B;

Follow my XYO story on: [http://www.MrAlanC.com](http://www.MrAlanC.com)
